{%- comment -%}
  Simply Kids — head assets
  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  This snippet exists so that layout/theme.liquid — the only Dawn file that
  carries a custom change — needs exactly ONE line:

      {% render 'sk-head' %}

  placed immediately after:

      {{ 'base.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

  Anything you later want in <head> goes in here, not in theme.liquid. That
  keeps the Dawn-side edit permanently at one line, so re-applying it after a
  Dawn update stays trivial.

  Fonts: linked, not embedded. The previous build inlined seven base64 WOFF2
  faces into v19.css (158 KB) AND loaded the same families from Google Fonts
  in theme.liquid — every visitor downloaded both.

  EXPECTED theme-check WARNINGS
  Shopify's theme-check reports four `RemoteAsset` warnings against this file —
  "Asset should be served by the Shopify CDN for better performance." They are
  the four Google Fonts lines below and they are deliberate. This theme is
  otherwise clean: run against Dawn 16 it produces 9 offenses, and with every
  Simply Kids file added it produces 13 — these four are the entire difference.

  If you would rather remove them, Theme settings > Typography can serve
  Nunito Sans from Shopify's own CDN. Two things to weigh first:

   · Dancing Script — the brand's script face, used on the routine times and
     on one or two words per heading — is not in Shopify's font library. You
     would either drop that treatment or keep one Google Fonts request for it.
   · Switching means repointing --sk-font-display / --sk-font-label /
     --sk-font-copy in sk-brand.css at Dawn's --font-body-family and
     --font-heading-family, rather than naming the families directly.

  That is a brand decision, not a technical one, so it is left as it is.
{%- endcomment -%}

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link
  rel="stylesheet"
  href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito+Sans:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Dancing+Script:wght@600;700&display=swap"
  media="print"
  onload="this.media='all'"
>
<noscript>
  <link
    rel="stylesheet"
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito+Sans:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Dancing+Script:wght@600;700&display=swap"
  >
</noscript>

{{ 'sk-brand.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
